{
    "pageid": 947,
    "title": "System requirements",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The system requirements are the basic specifications a PC will need to properly run Crusader Kings II . A PC that doesn't meet the specifications may not be able to run the game, or only poorly. For a smoother experience and faster loading, PCs ought to be well above the system requirements. The hardware requirements depend on the type of operating system the PC is running."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Microsoft Windows",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The game shipped with Windows support."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Operating system: Windows 7 64-bit",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Processor: Intel® Pentium® IV 2.4 GHz or AMD 3500+",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Memory: 2 GB RAM",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Hard disk space: 2 GB",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Video card: NVIDIA® GeForce 8800 or ATI Radeon® X1900, 512mb graphics memory required.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "DirectX®: 9.0c",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Sound: Direct X-compatible sound card",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Additional: 3-button mouse and keyboard",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Mac OS X",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "A Mac OS X version of Crusader Kings II was released on May 24, 2012."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Operating system: Mac OS X 10.9 or later",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Processor: Intel Core Duo Processor (2 GHz or better)",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Memory: 2 GB RAM",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Hard disk space: 2 GB",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Video card: ATI Radeon HD 6750/NVIDIA GeForce 320/NVIDIA GeForce 9600 or higher",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "With patch 3.3 the game switched to a 64-bits executable, allowing support for Mac OS Catalina."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Linux",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "A Linux version of Crusader Kings II was released on January 14, 2013."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Operating system: Ubuntu 14.04 LTS",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Processor: IntelR PentiumR IV 2.4 GHz or AMD 3500+",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Memory: 2 GB",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Hard disk space: 2 GB",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Video card: ATI Radeon HD 6750/NVIDIA GeForce 320/NVIDIA GeForce 9600 or higher, 1024MB graphics memory required.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
